{"datasets":{"sheet1":{"columns":[{"id":"c1","title":"A","type":"text"},{"id":"c2","title":"B","type":"text"},{"id":"c3","title":"C","type":"text"},{"id":"c4","title":"D","type":"text"}],"datasetID":"0e6aa046-11cf-4d16-9de1-cd6c210d7c01","title":"inventory-0.xlsm \u00b7 Inventory","writable":true}},"excelBehavior":{"actions":[{"id":"ship","inputs":[{"id":"quantity","title":"Quantity"}],"title":"Ship stock","writes":["sheet1!B2"]}],"gaps":[],"outputs":["sheet1!D2"],"source":"function recreate(input){const c=input.cells;if(input.event==='recalculate'){const oh=Number(c['sheet1!B2']);const ro=Number(c['sheet1!C2']);return{'sheet1!D2':String(Math.max(ro-oh,0))};}if(input.event==='ship'){const q=Number(input.arguments.quantity);const oh=Number(c['sheet1!B2']);if(!input.arguments.quantity.trim()||!Number.isFinite(q)||q<=0||q>oh)throw new Error('Quantity must be positive and not exceed On hand.');return{'sheet1!B2':String(oh-q)};}\nreturn {};}"},"name":"Inventory Stock Manager","sdkVersion":1,"source":"const {h,mount,Column,Text,TextField,Button,Table,signal,data}=Sevra;\nconst selected=signal(null),selection=signal(''),qty=signal(''),search=signal(''),busy=signal(false),status=signal('');\nfunction clear(){selected.value=null;selection.value='';qty.value='';status.value='';}\nfunction select(e){if(busy.value)return;const r=e.value;if(!r||r.values.c1==='Item'){clear();return;}selected.value=r;selection.value=r.key;qty.value='';status.value='';}\nasync function ship(){if(busy.value||!selected.value)return;const q=qty.value.trim();if(!q){status.value='Enter a quantity';return;}busy.value=true;try{await data.transaction([{op:'excel_action',action:'ship',arguments:{quantity:q}}]);clear();status.value='Stock shipped successfully.';}catch(e){status.value=e.message;}finally{busy.value=false;}}\nconst root=h(Column,{gap:16},h(Text,{text:'Inventory Stock Manager',size:24,weight:'bold'}),h(TextField,{label:'Search',value:search}),h(Table,{table:'sheet1',label:'Records',search,selection,onSelect:select,height:300,enabled:()=>!busy.value}),h(Text,{text:'Ship stock',size:18,weight:'semibold'}),h(Text,{text:'Quantity'}),h(TextField,{label:'Quantity',value:qty,enabled:()=>!busy.value&&!!selected.value}),h(Button,{title:'Ship stock',onClick:ship,enabled:()=>!busy.value&&!!selected.value&&qty.value.trim()!==''}),h(Text,{text:status}));\nmount(root);"}
